           : ┌───── DistributedExec
           : │ ProjectionExec: expr=[id@2 as col_1, title@1 as col_2, ctid_0@0 as ctid_0, ctid_1@3 as ctid_1]
           : │   SortPreservingMergeExec: [title@1 ASC NULLS LAST, id@2 ASC NULLS LAST], fetch=5
           : │     [Stage 2] => NetworkCoalesceExec: output_partitions=6, input_tasks=2
           : └──────────────────────────────────────────────────
           :   ┌───── Stage 2 ── tasks=2, partitions=6
           :   │ LocalLimitExec: fetch=5
           :   │   TantivyDecodeExec: decode=[title]
           :   │     SegmentedTopKExec: expr=[title@1 ASC NULLS LAST, id@2 ASC NULLS LAST], k=5, visibility_checks=[f, d]
           :   │       HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Inner, on=[(id@1, document_id@1)], projection=[ctid_0@2, title@4, id@5, ctid_1@0]
           :   │         CoalescePartitionsExec
           :   │           [Stage 1] => NetworkBroadcastExec: partitions_per_consumer=1, stage_partitions=2, input_tasks=1
           :   │         RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1
           :   │           DistributedLeafExec:
           :   │             t0: PgSearchScan: table=f, segments=2, fetch=[title], dynamic_filters=2, query="all"
           :   │             t1: PgSearchScan: table=f, segments=2, fetch=[title], dynamic_filters=2, query="all"
           :   └──────────────────────────────────────────────────
           :     ┌───── Stage 1 ── tasks=1, partitions=2
           :     │ BroadcastExec: input_partitions=1, consumer_tasks=2, output_partitions=2
           :     │   DistributedLeafExec:
           :     │     t0: PgSearchScan: table=d, segments=1, query={"with_index":{"query":{"parse_with_field":{"field":"category","query_string":"PROJECT_ALPHA","lenient":null,"conjunction_mode":null}}}}
           :     └──────────────────────────────────────────────────
